Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(checkout):=20el=20env=C3=ADo=20a=20domicili?=
 =?UTF-8?q?o=20se=20rechaza=20con=20SHIPPING=5FRATE=5FPENDING=20mientras?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20no=20haya=20tarifa=20autorizada,=20en=20vez=20de=20un=20inte?=
